lancing\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></a>Tweaks and Balancing</h2>\r\n<ul dir=\"auto\" data-sourcepos=\"21:1-26:0\">\r\n<li data-sourcepos=\"21:1-26:0\">#310 - Tweak some cloth ingredients to better match the item color:\r\n<ul data-sourcepos=\"22:3-26:0\">\r\n<li data-sourcepos=\"22:3-22:18\">pastoral shirt</li>\r\n<li data-sourcepos=\"23:3-23:19\">moon cloth robe</li>\r\n<li data-sourcepos=\"24:3-26:0\">fur coat and knee-high fur boots need some brown thread, plus lime</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We hope you enjoy our work,</p>\r\n<p>Tels &amp; Phiwa 💛</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<pre>-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----<br /><br />iQIzBAABCgAdFiEEPNPwZPus2b38SDJdchBxoDxWlFcFAmkQ2N8ACgkQchBxoDxW<br />lFfXHQ//bJPPc1p6OX0XjkLQ/LRQ4BeO/4/eBm+JELsHcMkuMWGXgP9/QiSIvAQU<br />YnKtcLKWO5ZQOcRF5rIeyyMej+3w5zN+lBIFGTKU7EPygXMMR5bdRy0znCiElHgD<br />LRLKAQorfS3Ag8PMKOmHw0SXD848gsBBolrhTbdFqb58X76V7SVjM+tEpiJPtuUv<br />KV4huXCj3fYzkByKSfC+K44zCQJwvqbVTXD1qwlQcVd1m6qu1vqNwlO2UWe3+gdQ<br />1XGImjbUvp+ZJsvrXxo2E4dQR50MQv04PFKC6ZJpT86oNAPhi6TWCesCXhMYSBQ/<br />PM4tFHW5S+TjONUwXDZ1o+5q6b4Xxbpp5fWpS0gIchZNRdsUZj1bIpPY9wsSKw8p<br />NFRBuw67EtKx23VC6KPzQUG/l9IXBySk8sRm0H9Tz8xrrdGpy2rqLchSOq66wsGN<br />aS6voYyMWatawp7mVB2AOXabCAmpI3A5g3qm4dQqdE2D/uNqou492hIYAsShqJL4<br />odrmGHgRuGFk75AGceCjoyWqFp62fw7BxCDqMzd1J78GIz5j7jfaugh1jGT2DRB4<br />5fdMCrK9XFMOKAbbs/dlT5uBhvnRMhK/1gt6/UX53lk9hEidwZUfac2EsZWLbnUT<br />mwyPBRVaZGqUK2XMpa5jBpCf36zGRKZ78BqSLyMbZFwrya6/3AU=<br />=eGvw<br />-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----</pre>",
